	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"3a397c72787b43a6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [The Plan - Psychoanalysis](ThePlan.canvas)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-232,
			"y":-50,
			"width":492,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"3f551e0559f3a6a9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Usually manifested as Ivanka/Vitka.\n\nDifferentiates from split Anima of puer aeternus by the influence. This figure is my Dante's Beatrice, that wants me to strive upwards\n\n**As result** I must not ignore it, but instead develop healthy relationship with the source of that manifestation. ",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-1186,
			"y":480,
			"width":346,
			"height":440
		},
		{
			"id":"2221142b4ca6cc65",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Identified complexes\n(which are predominately negative)\n- ##### Mother Complex\n\t- Puer Aeternus archetype\n- ##### Father Complex\n- ##### Inferiority Complex (Superiority mask)",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":520,
			"y":0,
			"width":386,
			"height":440
		},
		{
			"id":"ad881899c535481d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Manifestations\n- ##### I'm overwhelmed\n\t- t\n- ##### I don't know what to do\n\t- t \n- ##### Everything is hopeless and meaningless\n\t- t ",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":996,
			"y":0,
			"width":470,
			"height":520
		},
		{
			"id":"5b9c0d5902147aad",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Awareness",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":30,
			"y":360,
			"width":300,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"4b07b6790bf62e54",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Dream Analysis",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-680,
			"y":360,
			"width":360,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"55a10e110398e9db",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# The Anima",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1200,
			"y":360,
			"width":360,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"9854a72dc0a62d40",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Complexes",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":756,
			"y":-160,
			"width":300,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"774a9d2f5b83af2e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- ##### 12/09/2026\n\t- ###### 17:31\n\t\t- #### Got excited\n\t\t\t- When were watching that duo iphone and mkbd or whatever said that it's better than samsung because of lots of quality of life things. That's kinda what I want to do in my project, so that's why it felt good and made me work. \n\t\t\t\t\t",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-160,
			"y":480,
			"width":680,
			"height":440
		},
		{
			"id":"7a11594edc19c6db",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Can describe rules here. Hints, tips and tricks, personal patterns, etc.\n.\n### Why?\nTakes a lot of time and energy. BUT. It predicts future. Like through spending 1-3 hours on writing/analyzing I can save tens of hours down the line by making same mistakes again and again. \n.\nThe unconscious is decides where energy goes. If I'm not always recalibrating with it - I'll diverge and amount of energy will be reduced which will cause to dropping the work, extreme indulging, etc.\n.\n- **Rules**\n\t- Ask why the thing was there and why it wasn't excluded. \n\t\t- Like dream could not have it, but it did, with some purpose\n\n- Drunk dad - seems to be my Shadow, because although I'm not so keen on drinking, but impulsivity is there, where I can't just control myself\n- The Self - probably it was a monk.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-733,
			"y":480,
			"width":466,
			"height":680
		},
		{
			"id":"1da151c5449d8085",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Sadness/Hopelessness",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-680,
			"y":1200,
			"width":360,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"90aa26abe0f25b43",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Had a dream where mother figures, related to protection and soothing, were harmed. First of all my \"second mom\" jumped out of my balcony(survived with minor injuries), then my cat in a different dream, also survived, though was attacked by another cat. Cat isn't clear, but I remember that when I had nightmares and wake up being scared shitless - if my cat comes to me, it makes me feel less afraid. So there is kind protective part in her.\n\nHere's conclusion attempt\n**When you wake up sad and discouraged - what if it's purposeful? What if the unconscious tries to make you develop aMMC?**",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-733,
			"y":1320,
			"width":466,
			"height":400
		}
	],
